1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,240
This series was created
for entertainment purposes.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:05,680
The characters, actions, locations,
dialogue, languages, ceremonies,

3
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:08,120
and artistic elements depicted in this series

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:10,040
are fictional and based on imagination,

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:13,920
incorporating the beauty
of the region's diverse cultures,

6
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:18,400
including those
of Lanna, Myanmar, the Tai peoples, and China.

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,560
It is not intended to disrespect any history,

8
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:23,600
ethnic group, organization, profession,
or group of individuals.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,040
Viewer discretion is advised.

10
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:29,680
[Previously]
Will you look after her in my place?

11
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,080
The sooner you accept her passing,
the sooner your cousin can rest in peace.

12
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:42,200
I'm so sorry I wasn't there for you
when you were suffering.

13
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,200
Do you really want Fongnuan
to become Saen Thep's consort?

14
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,440
You should be happy for him,
not raise your voice at me.

15
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,360
We've had a bountiful rice harvest this year.

16
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:59,360
The city has plenty of water,
and the rice fields all around are flourishing,

17
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:02,560
thanks to the weir system we've built.

18
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:07,040
Yet the region bordering Merng Mang
is suffering from drought.

19
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:11,400
Merng Mang itself is facing a severe drought.
Its rice crops have failed.

20
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:15,240
As a result, rice theft has become rampant.

21
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:17,800
To protect against drought

22
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:22,200
and secure rice reserves for next year,

23
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:24,840
we'll lead an expedition to build a weir...

24
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:28,680
in the upstream city of Huai Khun Ka.

25
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:34,000
Indraraja, you will lead this expedition.

26
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,080
As you command, Your Majesty.

27
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,200
Jom Harn, Fah Haam, and Kong Tai,

28
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:45,520
you shall give Indraraja your full support.

29
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:51,960
- As you command, Your Majesty.
- As you command, Your Majesty.

30
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:55,320
As you command, Your Majesty.

31
00:01:56,520 --> 00:02:01,880
Muen In, send word to Saen Si Wiang at once.

32
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:05,880
Have him notify the Irrigation Steward,
Chief Weir Warden, Agricultural Steward,

33
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,200
and Water Overseer.

34
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:11,320
- They must all stand ready.
- As you command, Your Majesty.

35
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:26,480
Mueang Fah will already be accompanying
the procession as a royal guard.

36
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:31,880
May I also have him help build the weir?

37
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,040
During his time in Merng Mang,

38
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:40,400
Prince Mueang Fah often helped
the villagers build weirs.

39
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:44,520
Driving stakes across the entire river
to build a weir...

40
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:47,440
is difficult and dangerous work.

41
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:49,000
Even in the dry season,

42
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,640
parts of the river may still be
deep and fast-flowing.

43
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:59,440
Building a weir requires someone
with Prince Mueang Fah's experience.

44
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:03,800
Water management is
the backbone of our kingdom.

45
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,680
For a task this important,

46
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:09,880
we need someone
who can share the responsibility,

47
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:12,480
for the good of our people, Your Majesty.

48
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,520
I'll leave that to you.

49
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:45,040
As for you, as the Third-in-Line,

50
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:50,960
you shall remain here
and rule in my stead as Regent.

51
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:07,800
As you command, Your Majesty.

52
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:03,680
[The Journey]

53
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:07,760
Father has set a trap for you.

54
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:14,320
You'll be ruling in his stead as Regent.

55
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:19,680
If you make a mistake,
you could lose your title as the Third-in-Line.

56
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:23,400
You might even lose your head.

57
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:27,880
Your father trusts you to govern Ullavee.

58
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:30,960
This is your chance to prove yourself.

59
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:35,040
Serve him with unwavering loyalty.

60
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:40,160
If you work diligently and prove your worth,

61
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:46,040
nobles of every rank will praise you
and gladly lend you their support.

62
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:49,360
You have nothing to fear.

63
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:53,960
What good will that do him?
Father favors Indraraja above everyone else.

64
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:58,800
Now that they're building a weir together,
he has even more chances to impress Father.

65
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:05,160
Indraraja isn't the only one
your father favors.

66
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:10,000
I've heard he's especially fond of Fongnuan.

67
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:15,080
She's still one of us.
She's family, after all.

68
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:17,320
If you ask for her help,

69
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:22,240
surely she can help the King see your worth.

70
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:29,960
I wouldn't expect too much from her.
She's not quite sane.

71
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,760
Have you forgotten?

72
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:38,200
Fongnuan may not be her old self,
but she has a good heart.

73
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:42,480
Her knowledge and skills
have earned her Father's favor.

74
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,320
Don't underestimate her.

75
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:56,360
Be careful.
One day, she may get you into trouble.

76
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:05,320
On this weir expedition,

77
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:09,200
I'd like you to support Jom Harn
rather than Indraraja.

78
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:15,840
You must help Jom Harn
prove himself to the King.

79
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,360
You know very well...

80
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:23,600
whoever controls the weir
controls the people there,

81
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:27,320
and the rice grown in the fields it irrigates.

82
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:35,120
A prince who is close to the common people
and builds weirs for them...

83
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:38,560
will surely win their hearts.

84
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:46,800
If you still see Jom Harn as your brother,

85
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:53,640
you'll support his claim to the throne.

86
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,480
If you do as I ask,

87
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,000
I'll be willing...

88
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:13,800
to overlook the hour of your birth.

89
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,080
I'll help him,

90
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:36,520
but only if Jom Harn asks me himself.

91
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:39,200
Can't your own mother ask you for a favor?

92
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,360
Don't call yourself my mother...

93
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:48,400
unless you truly see me as your son.

94
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:56,320
I'm not worthy of being your son.

95
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:59,920
Your father trusts you to govern Ullavee.

96
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:03,520
This is your chance to prove yourself.

97
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:07,480
Serve him with unwavering loyalty.

98
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:10,080
Prove your worth.

99
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:15,840
Nobles of every rank will praise you
and gladly lend you their support.

100
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:40,160
- I pay my respects to you, Your Majesty.
- I pay my respects to you, Your Majesty.

101
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:00,600
You should control yourself.

102
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:03,560
Otherwise, others may realize...

103
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:08,080
how desperately you want to become King.

104
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,200
I'm only warning you for your own good.

105
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:20,080
I don't want our family to be disgraced.

106
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:32,440
Then take your own advice.

107
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:37,880
A woman who covets the throne
so desperately...

108
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:42,040
is no less a disgrace.

109
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:12,840
Did Father really stop working
just because she asked him to?

110
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,240
Yes, Your Highness.

111
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:16,520
Everyone in Wiang Kaew has heard the news.

112
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:20,640
His Majesty greatly trusts Fongnuan.

113
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:25,960
He sends for her every night.
All the princes are close to her.

114
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:30,120
They're constantly visiting her.

115
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:32,600
Even Prince Saen Thep visits her.

116
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:43,880
If you hear anything else,
report it to me at once.

117
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,520
Yes, Your Highness.

118
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:54,280
- You may leave now.
- Yes.

119
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:08,640
I thought I'd get to stay with you
in Wiang Kaew.

120
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:13,200
I'm not coming with you,
but I have something for you to take.

121
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:32,080
This bracelet is set with Phantom Amethyst.

122
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:38,840
It's one of the rarest gemstones.

123
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:40,760
Those who wear it...

124
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:46,080
will enjoy protection and good fortune,
peace and happiness.

125
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,680
It will enhance your charm and prestige.

126
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:52,640
Wherever you go, you'll be loved,
and treated with kindness.

127
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:55,520
Phantom Amethyst.

128
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:59,120
It sounds quite powerful.

129
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,920
I'm giving it to you...

130
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:09,120
because I believe you'll see its worth,

131
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,800
just as you've seen mine.

132
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,640
Your Highness.

133
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:21,840
I won't force you.

134
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:25,480
But if you're willing...

135
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,360
will you promise...

136
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:32,640
to keep this bracelet with you always?

137
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:38,360
I'll treasure it.

138
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:45,880
Kong Tai.

139
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:51,120
Mother! We're here.

140
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:58,320
Why haven't you two started packing?

141
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:02,000
I've been ready to leave
since Father gave the order.

142
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:09,120
Are you so eager to leave
because Muen In's daughter is going too?

143
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:17,320
Mother, I'm ready to join the procession.

144
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,600
But I don't want to go.

145
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:26,960
Why not?

146
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:31,840
Father rarely takes us all
outside Wiang Kaew together,

147
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:35,760
even if Saen Thep can't join us this time.

148
00:16:36,880 --> 00:16:40,720
We're going there to work.
That hardly sounds like fun.

149
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:51,040
Look on the bright side.

150
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:54,920
Don't think of it as work.

151
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:59,760
It's a chance to get away,
and see more of the world.

152
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:03,480
You're always sneaking away to have fun.

153
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:07,040
Why are you so reluctant to go?

154
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:11,320
It's not far from Wiang Kaew.
All the more reason to be pleased.

155
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:26,080
A bird that gets to explore new skies,

156
00:17:26,080 --> 00:17:29,800
even if it must eventually
return to the same nest,

157
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:35,280
is better off than one
that never gets to leave.

158
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:45,520
You're right.

159
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:56,360
You know me better than I know myself.

160
00:17:56,360 --> 00:18:01,920
How could I look after you both
if I didn't know you so well?

161
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:08,920
Especially you.
You're always giving her a headache.

162
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:12,320
- Me?
- You're always frowning.

163
00:18:12,320 --> 00:18:14,840
You're both as bad as each other.

164
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:20,480
At least I'm not lovesick like you.

165
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:23,560
Mother!

166
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:29,040
Look at Kong Tai.

167
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,960
You're both as bad as each other.

168
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:54,560
There's someone you should
be especially wary of on this journey.

169
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:56,480
Who?

170
00:18:58,120 --> 00:19:00,000
Fongnuan.

171
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:05,920
Word has spread throughout Wiang Kaew
that she's become Father's favorite.

172
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:08,120
He trusts her.

173
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:15,320
You must prove your worth soon,

174
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:18,720
before Father values her more than you.

175
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:23,520
I've already asked Mueang Fah
to keep an eye on her.

176
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:32,280
If she causes too much trouble,
we'll simply get rid of her.

177
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:38,680
She's only a lady-in-waiting.
No one will care if she dies.

178
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,880
Prince Fah Haam.

179
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:15,440
I thought you weren't coming.

180
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:22,520
Whenever you miss me, just look at this.

181
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,320
A fiddle.

182
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:51,040
Why would I miss you?

183
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:57,600
You'll find out once you get there...

184
00:20:57,600 --> 00:21:00,320
whether you miss me or not.

185
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:04,640
Have a safe journey, and come back alive.

186
00:21:05,280 --> 00:21:08,880
Is that a blessing...

187
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:11,760
or a curse?

188
00:21:15,800 --> 00:21:18,400
Just make sure you come back alive.

189
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:49,960
On this royal journey,
in addition to guarding the procession,

190
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:55,120
you must attend to the King
and all the princes.

191
00:21:55,120 --> 00:21:56,280
Yes.

192
00:22:02,840 --> 00:22:03,960
Your Highness.

193
00:22:04,680 --> 00:22:06,520
Is everyone ready?

194
00:22:07,800 --> 00:22:11,400
I am Dao Kaew. It's an honor to serve you.

195
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:17,040
I am Prince Kong Tai.

196
00:22:17,040 --> 00:22:20,600
You should get to know me better,
so you'll know how to take care of me.

197
00:22:27,440 --> 00:22:28,680
Your Highness.

198
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:41,080
Careful not to drop or break anything.

199
00:23:04,080 --> 00:23:08,760
Lha, since you're staying here,
I'll leave you in charge.

200
00:23:08,760 --> 00:23:11,600
Make sure everything is in order.

201
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:12,840
Yes, my lady.

202
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:22,360
Please take care of yourself, Lady Fongnuan.

203
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:32,880
You'll see each other again soon.

204
00:23:40,040 --> 00:23:42,120
Hurry along, everyone.

205
00:23:43,120 --> 00:23:45,560
Stay here and make sure everything is in order.

206
00:23:47,200 --> 00:23:48,360
Yes.

207
00:25:02,520 --> 00:25:04,320
Why are you following me?

208
00:25:05,800 --> 00:25:08,200
I just wanted to thank you, Your Highness.

209
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:14,040
I suppose you don't remember me.

210
00:25:29,800 --> 00:25:31,360
Let go of me!

211
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:34,960
No! Let go!

212
00:25:53,600 --> 00:25:57,640
We've captured the bandit leader,
Crown Prince Pha Wiang.

213
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:03,840
The border is crawling with bandits.
Leave this area if you value your life.

214
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:11,560
Let's go.

215
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:24,840
I remember now.

216
00:26:29,560 --> 00:26:31,360
Ever since that night,

217
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:36,440
I've kept this knife with me...

218
00:26:37,600 --> 00:26:41,480
in the hope that I'd see you again.

219
00:26:42,080 --> 00:26:47,960
I wanted to thank you
for saving my life, Your Highness.

220
00:27:01,120 --> 00:27:05,640
What were you doing
in the forest near the border?

221
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:08,200
I'm a lady-in-waiting.

222
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:13,120
I was accompanying Princess Maneethip
and Lady Fongnuan from Wang Nam Lin.

223
00:27:13,960 --> 00:27:16,320
Bandits ambushed our procession.

224
00:27:16,320 --> 00:27:22,120
I led Princess Maneethip and Lady Fongnuan
to safety and drew the bandits away.

225
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:31,040
I was fortunate you came to my rescue,
Your Highness.

226
00:27:31,040 --> 00:27:33,160
What brings you here?

227
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:38,560
After Princess Maneethip passed away,

228
00:27:38,560 --> 00:27:42,640
Prince Saen Thep arranged for me
to serve as a lady-in-waiting

229
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:45,360
alongside Lady Fongnuan in Wiang Kaew.

230
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:49,880
Lady Fongnuan? The one who serves the King?

231
00:27:50,720 --> 00:27:52,280
Yes, Your Highness.

232
00:27:54,360 --> 00:27:59,000
I've heard that
His Majesty is particularly fond of her.

233
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:04,360
I wouldn't know, Your Highness.

234
00:28:04,360 --> 00:28:08,160
I know nothing of my lady's affairs.

235
00:28:12,640 --> 00:28:16,600
You carry yourself well,
as a lady-in-waiting at Wiang Kaew should.

236
00:28:19,360 --> 00:28:23,600
I often visit Indraraja in Wiang Kaew.

237
00:28:26,640 --> 00:28:29,800
I'll visit you at Lady Homjan's residence.

238
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:35,080
There's no need to run after me like this.

239
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:39,280
I'll come to you.

240
00:28:43,360 --> 00:28:47,160
Keep this with you. Don't lose it.

241
00:29:39,560 --> 00:29:42,120
- Royal Consort Sukantha.
- Royal Consort Sukantha.

242
00:29:42,120 --> 00:29:44,920
- Royal Consort Chiang La-or.
- Royal Consort Chiang La-or.

243
00:29:46,520 --> 00:29:49,000
How fortunate you are, Chiang La-or.

244
00:29:50,120 --> 00:29:54,720
Neither of your children
has to join the weir expedition.

245
00:29:56,240 --> 00:30:00,120
You'll have your children with you,
so you won't be lonely.

246
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:02,600
Unlike me.

247
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:06,800
Both my sons are leaving.

248
00:30:09,040 --> 00:30:10,920
I'll be terribly lonely.

249
00:30:12,760 --> 00:30:15,920
So you consider Mueang Fah your son now?

250
00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:25,360
Both your sons may be going,
but one is merely serving as a soldier,

251
00:30:25,360 --> 00:30:28,240
while the other is last in line to the throne.

252
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:31,000
My son may be staying behind,

253
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:34,720
but he's been entrusted
with the duties of Regent.

254
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:41,320
It's rather awkward for me, too,

255
00:30:41,320 --> 00:30:47,280
now that Saen Thep has risen to power
and is ruling in the King's stead.

256
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:50,280
Meanwhile,

257
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:56,800
you'll be subject to my son's authority.

258
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:05,960
It's only temporary.

259
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:09,280
Once the rightful King returns,
your son will be back where he started.

260
00:31:11,640 --> 00:31:14,040
Power is intoxicating.

261
00:31:15,040 --> 00:31:17,440
Once you've tasted it, you'll crave more.

262
00:31:18,720 --> 00:31:24,200
Once it's taken away,
beware how painful that longing can be.

263
00:31:27,520 --> 00:31:29,360
I'm merely warning you,

264
00:31:30,640 --> 00:31:32,360
not trying to wound your pride.

265
00:31:53,280 --> 00:31:58,680
[Huai Khun Ka]

266
00:32:08,360 --> 00:32:12,680
Everyone, put these things away.

267
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:14,760
Then you may go and rest.

268
00:32:14,760 --> 00:32:16,240
There's no need to cook today.

269
00:32:16,240 --> 00:32:19,080
Saen Si Wiang is hosting a banquet
to welcome the King.

270
00:32:19,080 --> 00:32:20,840
- Yes, my lady.
- Yes, my lady.

271
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:29,960
My lady. Who is Saen Si Wiang?

272
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:31,960
A local nobleman.

273
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:34,280
Huai Khun Ka may be a small outlying city,

274
00:32:34,280 --> 00:32:37,760
but Huai Khun Ka Mountain is
the source of Ullavee's water supply.

275
00:32:37,760 --> 00:32:40,920
Water management is of great importance
to His Majesty.

276
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:45,920
That's why he appointed Saen Si Wiang,
a nobleman he trusts, to govern this city.

277
00:32:47,320 --> 00:32:52,240
See to things here.
I'll go and check on the banquet preparations.

278
00:32:52,240 --> 00:32:53,520
Yes, my lady.

279
00:33:20,320 --> 00:33:21,840
Junior.

280
00:33:24,600 --> 00:33:28,160
If you need a hand with anything,
just let me know.

281
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,600
No need.

282
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:33,200
We've nearly finished putting things away.

283
00:33:41,840 --> 00:33:46,080
You haven't finished
your Jerng lessons with me.

284
00:33:46,080 --> 00:33:47,720
Would you like to continue?

285
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:51,960
When would I find the time?

286
00:33:53,120 --> 00:33:54,600
At night.

287
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:57,560
Once you've finished your work,
and Father has gone to bed,

288
00:33:57,560 --> 00:33:59,480
you'll have plenty of time.

289
00:33:59,480 --> 00:34:02,320
When am I supposed to sleep, Senior?

290
00:34:02,320 --> 00:34:06,280
But this is for your own good, Junior.

291
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:12,600
We're deep in the wilderness.
We're far from civilization.

292
00:34:12,600 --> 00:34:16,360
Bandits could attack us at any time.

293
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:19,560
Women could suffer far worse than robbery.

294
00:34:19,560 --> 00:34:24,200
You'd be wise to learn how to defend yourself.

295
00:34:24,200 --> 00:34:25,920
I'll teach you.

296
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,680
Deal?

297
00:34:30,080 --> 00:34:31,920
Deal, I suppose.

298
00:34:31,920 --> 00:34:35,280
But I don't know if I'll have
any strength left to train.

299
00:34:35,880 --> 00:34:37,000
Come now.

300
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:38,800
There you are!

301
00:34:39,520 --> 00:34:41,360
I've been looking everywhere.

302
00:34:41,360 --> 00:34:42,920
For whom?

303
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:45,920
Both of you, of course.

304
00:34:47,240 --> 00:34:50,280
I need your advice on something important.

305
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,480
You're acting suspiciously.

306
00:34:58,640 --> 00:35:00,000
I'm not.

307
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:12,480
Follow me.

308
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:21,800
Dao Kaew.

309
00:35:22,880 --> 00:35:26,360
Wait, you like Dao Kaew?

310
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:27,720
She's a force of nature.

311
00:35:27,720 --> 00:35:29,440
- A force of nature?
- A force of nature?

312
00:35:30,800 --> 00:35:33,800
She looks so strong and fearless.

313
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:35,920
That's exactly what I like about her.

314
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:38,880
A woman who's brave,
and can look after herself.

315
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:41,920
Not one who's always causing trouble,

316
00:35:41,920 --> 00:35:45,120
giving everyone headaches,
and drinking all day.

317
00:35:46,120 --> 00:35:47,360
Are you insulting me?

318
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:50,880
Of course not. Who'd help me if I offended you?

319
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:56,520
What do you need my advice on?

320
00:35:57,680 --> 00:35:59,360
Tell me.

321
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:05,000
What should I do to win her heart?

322
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:08,360
Knowing Dao Kaew...

323
00:36:08,360 --> 00:36:12,320
If I asked Father to arrange our marriage,

324
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:16,640
and she had no feelings for me,
she'd surely take her own life.

325
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:19,000
You're right, Dao Kaew.

326
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:22,200
Marrying someone you don't love
is worse than death.

327
00:36:22,200 --> 00:36:23,480
Excuse me?

328
00:36:24,040 --> 00:36:28,360
I asked you to help me,
not encourage Dao Kaew to take her own life.

329
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:36,000
Please tell me how to win her heart.

330
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:43,160
Knowing how strong-willed Dao Kaew is,
if you wrote her a song or sent her a poem--

331
00:36:43,160 --> 00:36:44,760
She'd throw it away.

332
00:36:46,680 --> 00:36:50,680
- If you tried to charm her with sweet words...
- She wouldn't be interested.

333
00:36:54,160 --> 00:36:56,480
I might as well give up, then.

334
00:36:56,480 --> 00:37:00,520
That's probably for the best. I'm only joking.

335
00:37:01,520 --> 00:37:04,480
Senior, help me come up with something!

336
00:37:09,200 --> 00:37:10,960
What are you all looking at?

337
00:37:14,120 --> 00:37:16,000
Mueang Fah.

338
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:19,920
I'm just making sure
everything is in order here.

339
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:21,840
Is something wrong?

340
00:37:28,880 --> 00:37:32,040
Father has sent for you, Kong Tai.

341
00:37:33,080 --> 00:37:35,520
He wants you to prepare for tonight's banquet.

342
00:37:35,520 --> 00:37:37,200
Me?

343
00:37:38,200 --> 00:37:40,000
Why do I have to go first?

344
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:43,960
I don't know. Go on.
You'll find out soon enough.

345
00:37:46,040 --> 00:37:49,240
Hurry, before he gets angry.

346
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:05,840
If you'll excuse me, I should get back to work.

347
00:38:29,440 --> 00:38:34,320
Do you think Dao Kaew
could ever fall for Kong Tai?

348
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:40,200
Well, you should know better than I do.

349
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:58,240
Don't play with sharp objects.
You could hurt yourself.

350
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:08,520
Why are you walking away from me?

351
00:39:08,520 --> 00:39:12,960
I'm not walking away from you.
I just need to get back to work.

352
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:17,040
You're never in such a hurry
when you're with my brothers.

353
00:39:17,040 --> 00:39:19,800
- That has nothing to do with it.
- Of course it does.

354
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:25,120
You laugh so freely with everyone else.
Why do you always seem so afraid of me?

355
00:39:25,120 --> 00:39:28,240
The reason is obvious, Your Highness.

356
00:39:31,160 --> 00:39:33,400
Why do you like being around men?

357
00:39:34,120 --> 00:39:36,440
It's not that I like being around men.

358
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:40,720
It's just a coincidence.
Even this meeting wasn't intentional.

359
00:39:40,720 --> 00:39:44,920
I'd better go before you accuse me
of seeking men's company again.

360
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:50,280
We're deep in the forest.
Danger lurks everywhere.

361
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:51,840
Don't go anywhere alone.

362
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:55,680
I can't go anywhere alone.
I can't be around men either.

363
00:39:55,680 --> 00:39:57,720
So what am I supposed to do?

364
00:39:59,680 --> 00:40:02,720
Just make sure you don't go anywhere alone.

365
00:40:03,640 --> 00:40:07,480
Understood. Please excuse me.
I must get back to work.

366
00:40:09,760 --> 00:40:13,080
You're always playing with knives and swords.
You're the most dangerous one here.

367
00:40:22,600 --> 00:40:26,240
Seer Phrommaya has chosen an auspicious time

368
00:40:26,240 --> 00:40:29,360
for the Weir Spirit Ceremony
at the Weir Spirit Shrine.

369
00:40:29,360 --> 00:40:31,160
It will precede tomorrow's construction.

370
00:40:31,160 --> 00:40:36,400
I've already instructed the Irrigation Steward
to make all the arrangements.

371
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:40,640
Thank you for seeing to all the preparations.

372
00:40:41,280 --> 00:40:44,480
I thoroughly enjoyed today's banquet.

373
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:51,280
Huai Khun Ka may be a small valley city,
but it's vital to our kingdom.

374
00:40:51,280 --> 00:40:54,400
Its waters sustain Ullavee.

375
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:58,600
I'm grateful for how well
you've looked after this city.

376
00:40:59,280 --> 00:41:03,480
All the credit goes to Pathumma.

377
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:06,440
She oversaw all the preparations.

378
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:12,600
Your Majesty has been most gracious to us,
bringing peace and prosperity to the kingdom.

379
00:41:12,600 --> 00:41:16,080
All I can offer in return...

380
00:41:16,080 --> 00:41:20,560
is to serve Your Majesty faithfully
and to the best of my ability.

381
00:41:43,560 --> 00:41:48,280
Didn't I tell you? We're deep in the forest.

382
00:41:48,280 --> 00:41:52,240
Danger lurks everywhere.
Don't go anywhere alone.

383
00:41:53,040 --> 00:41:57,400
I have no choice. I still have work to do.

384
00:41:58,440 --> 00:41:59,880
Please excuse me.

385
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:24,560
Are you following me, Your Highness?
Why are you following me?

386
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:36,400
Please put your dagger away!

387
00:42:36,400 --> 00:42:40,040
Follow me if you wish. I won't ask again.

388
00:43:01,400 --> 00:43:04,200
All these petitions concern the same matter.

389
00:43:04,200 --> 00:43:10,160
Caravan merchants from neighboring cities
have come together to petition for justice.

390
00:43:10,160 --> 00:43:13,640
Prince Indraraja is only Crown Prince,

391
00:43:13,640 --> 00:43:16,120
yet he's already abusing his power
to extort the people.

392
00:43:16,120 --> 00:43:20,720
How much worse will it be once he becomes King?

393
00:43:24,880 --> 00:43:30,000
These are serious allegations.
We cannot accuse anyone without evidence.

394
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:32,360
I've already sent men
to question the villagers,

395
00:43:32,360 --> 00:43:34,080
and confirmed...

396
00:43:34,080 --> 00:43:37,200
that Prince Pha Wiang told
the caravan merchants

397
00:43:37,200 --> 00:43:41,680
that Prince Indraraja ordered him
to collect additional protection tribute.

398
00:43:41,680 --> 00:43:47,280
Merchants from neighboring cities are upset.
They've all been affected.

399
00:43:47,280 --> 00:43:53,240
If they unite against us,
our trade will surely suffer, Your Highness.

400
00:43:53,240 --> 00:43:55,600
The people fear...

401
00:43:55,600 --> 00:43:59,920
Prince Indraraja may start demanding
tribute from Ullavee's merchants as well.

402
00:44:01,360 --> 00:44:05,760
King Chai Saen Lue governs Ullavee
by the Ten Virtues of a Righteous King.

403
00:44:05,760 --> 00:44:09,040
He has never oppressed, extorted, or exploited
caravan merchants,

404
00:44:09,040 --> 00:44:11,160
whether local or foreign.

405
00:44:11,160 --> 00:44:15,040
Nothing like this has ever happened
in our kingdom.

406
00:44:15,040 --> 00:44:17,600
If these allegations are true,

407
00:44:17,600 --> 00:44:22,080
Prince Indraraja is unfit to be Crown Prince.

408
00:44:25,240 --> 00:44:28,680
Let me examine these petitions carefully.

409
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:31,600
In the meantime,

410
00:44:31,600 --> 00:44:36,160
I want you to investigate this matter
and gather more evidence.

411
00:44:37,600 --> 00:44:43,000
I'll summon you all again
to discuss the matter further.

412
00:44:44,000 --> 00:44:45,280
- Yes, Your Highness.
- Yes, Your Highness.

413
00:45:08,000 --> 00:45:10,560
You must inform the King at once.

414
00:45:10,560 --> 00:45:13,040
I want to establish the facts first...

415
00:45:13,040 --> 00:45:16,960
and gather solid evidence
before informing Father.

416
00:45:16,960 --> 00:45:19,800
Otherwise, I'd be accusing Indraraja
without proof.

417
00:45:23,400 --> 00:45:25,520
I agree with Saen Thep.

418
00:45:26,280 --> 00:45:30,800
If the allegations are false,
we have more to lose than to gain, Mother.

419
00:45:30,800 --> 00:45:32,800
How could they be false?

420
00:45:33,480 --> 00:45:38,640
You said yourself
that the noblemen confirmed them.

421
00:45:44,440 --> 00:45:49,520
If you neglect the duties
your father entrusted to you,

422
00:45:49,520 --> 00:45:52,600
you won't be the only one in trouble.

423
00:45:52,600 --> 00:45:57,880
Hongkham and I will be punished, too.

424
00:46:12,600 --> 00:46:14,600
I will report this.

425
00:46:16,480 --> 00:46:20,320
But I must discuss the matter
with the noblemen first.

426
00:46:20,320 --> 00:46:24,800
Once I'm certain of the facts,
I'll inform Father at once.

427
00:47:13,480 --> 00:47:16,760
I've never seen this tea set before.

428
00:47:16,760 --> 00:47:22,480
Fongnuan designed these tea sets
to represent each of the princes, Your Majesty.

429
00:47:23,400 --> 00:47:28,160
Fongnuan, what do these symbols mean?

430
00:47:28,160 --> 00:47:32,040
The peacock symbolizes royal dignity,

431
00:47:32,040 --> 00:47:35,280
wealth, and prosperity.

432
00:47:38,000 --> 00:47:40,920
Prince Indraraja's symbol is a hawk,

433
00:47:40,920 --> 00:47:44,160
representing determination and perseverance,

434
00:47:44,160 --> 00:47:47,160
a willingness to do whatever it takes
to achieve one's goals.

435
00:47:48,760 --> 00:47:53,800
Prince Kong Tai's symbol is a pheasant,

436
00:47:53,800 --> 00:47:58,120
representing cheerfulness, charm,
and good fortune.

437
00:48:00,360 --> 00:48:03,920
Prince Fah Haam's symbol is a mustang,

438
00:48:04,560 --> 00:48:10,000
representing freedom, agility,
and individuality.

439
00:48:10,000 --> 00:48:13,360
Prince Jom Harn's symbol is a wild bear,

440
00:48:13,360 --> 00:48:18,280
representing courage, warmth, and precision.

441
00:48:21,480 --> 00:48:24,120
What about Saen Thep?

442
00:48:24,120 --> 00:48:25,400
Does he have one?

443
00:48:26,520 --> 00:48:27,680
Yes.

444
00:48:27,680 --> 00:48:31,240
Prince Saen Thep's symbol is a stag,

445
00:48:31,240 --> 00:48:34,760
representing duty, discipline,

446
00:48:34,760 --> 00:48:37,720
and compassion for others.

447
00:48:40,920 --> 00:48:44,320
Prince Mueang Fah's symbol is a wolf,

448
00:48:45,160 --> 00:48:50,040
representing strength,
loyalty, and devotion to family.

449
00:48:51,040 --> 00:48:55,280
You know my sons better than I do.

450
00:48:55,280 --> 00:48:58,880
Once we return to Ullavee,
I'll reward you handsomely.

451
00:49:01,800 --> 00:49:04,080
The idea may have been Fongnuan's,

452
00:49:04,080 --> 00:49:08,320
but surely she didn't make all these tea sets
by herself?

453
00:49:13,320 --> 00:49:14,600
No, Your Highness.

454
00:49:15,280 --> 00:49:18,480
The other ladies-in-waiting
at Wiang Kaew helped me.

455
00:49:18,480 --> 00:49:22,400
In that case, I hope...

456
00:49:22,400 --> 00:49:25,560
you'll share Father's reward...

457
00:49:25,560 --> 00:49:28,520
with everyone who helped you.

458
00:49:29,480 --> 00:49:30,480
Yes, Your Highness.

459
00:49:30,480 --> 00:49:34,200
I have plenty of people to do the work.
What I need are people with ideas.

460
00:49:34,200 --> 00:49:37,280
Leave the work to the other ladies-in-waiting.

461
00:49:37,960 --> 00:49:40,280
I'm quite happy with things as they are.

462
00:49:43,800 --> 00:49:46,080
Thank you, Your Majesty.

463
00:50:00,640 --> 00:50:04,280
Muen Wong Sa and Muen Phak Dee
from Phu Chiang Kham...

464
00:50:04,280 --> 00:50:07,560
request an audience with Regent Saen Thep.

465
00:50:10,200 --> 00:50:11,880
Let them in.

466
00:50:30,040 --> 00:50:32,840
His Majesty is away overseeing
the construction of a weir.

467
00:50:32,840 --> 00:50:35,360
I am serving as Regent.

468
00:50:36,080 --> 00:50:37,840
What brings you here?

469
00:50:37,840 --> 00:50:41,560
We are Muen Wong Sa and Muen Phak Dee.

470
00:50:41,560 --> 00:50:44,840
We've come
to offer golden thread and jewelry,

471
00:50:44,840 --> 00:50:49,000
made by our finest artisans, to His Majesty.

472
00:50:58,760 --> 00:51:03,760
Phu Chiang Kham
is renowned for its rich gold deposits,

473
00:51:03,760 --> 00:51:06,640
both on land and in its rivers.

474
00:51:06,640 --> 00:51:11,000
I'll inform His Majesty
of the tribute you've brought.

475
00:51:11,000 --> 00:51:13,680
I thank you on His Majesty's behalf.

476
00:52:34,080 --> 00:52:39,600
Once I ascend the throne,
everything in this palace will be mine.

477
00:52:39,600 --> 00:52:41,400
Will it not?

478
00:52:44,560 --> 00:52:49,160
Everything in this palace will be mine.

479
00:53:58,520 --> 00:53:59,880
Hey.

480
00:53:59,880 --> 00:54:01,280
It took me ages to find this place.

481
00:54:01,280 --> 00:54:03,440
What kind of library is this?
Why is it so hard to find?

482
00:54:03,440 --> 00:54:06,840
It's just as our boss said.
Records are hard to come by.

483
00:54:06,840 --> 00:54:10,400
This is probably the only place
that still has records of Ullavee.

484
00:54:10,400 --> 00:54:13,360
- The only place?
- Yes.

485
00:54:27,880 --> 00:54:29,760
[Ancient Pagodas and Stupas of Myanmar]

486
00:55:23,360 --> 00:55:24,560
Hey.

487
00:55:25,120 --> 00:55:26,320
Hey.

488
00:55:29,120 --> 00:55:30,600
That looks exhausting.

489
00:56:10,400 --> 00:56:12,160
How did this get here?

490
00:56:31,360 --> 00:56:32,680
Delicious.

491
00:57:02,040 --> 00:57:05,040
Hey. Thank you.

492
00:57:18,320 --> 00:57:19,200
[Next Week]

493
00:57:19,200 --> 00:57:21,920
Everyone can see now

494
00:57:21,920 --> 00:57:25,880
that you're better suited to be Crown Prince
than Indraraja.

495
00:57:25,880 --> 00:57:27,480
You two are so alike.

496
00:57:27,480 --> 00:57:31,840
Now I see
where your daughter gets her vile nature.

497
00:57:31,840 --> 00:57:34,800
I said I'd come to see you.
I had to keep my promise.

498
00:57:34,800 --> 00:57:39,800
If Father believes the rumor,
I cannot afford to pay for your actions.

499
00:57:39,800 --> 00:57:44,000
A petition accusing Crown Prince Indraraja
of demanding tribute for protection.

500
00:57:44,000 --> 00:57:45,120
These accusations are false.

501
00:57:45,120 --> 00:57:49,200
If they're true, it will cost you your title.

502
00:57:49,200 --> 00:57:54,160
It's time to expose Indraraja's misdeeds.

503
00:57:54,840 --> 00:57:58,560
I hope you never lose
that cheerful spirit of yours.

504
00:57:58,560 --> 00:58:03,160
May nothing ever rob you
of your smile or laughter.

505
00:58:03,160 --> 00:58:07,040
My feelings for you may have begun
with a misunderstanding.

506
00:58:07,040 --> 00:58:10,480
But now, I can't help how I feel.
